## Frontend Development

To run the web module locally with instant hot-module replacement outside Docker:

```sh
cd web
npm ci
npm run dev
```

The local Vite dev server also runs with HTTPS using a generated self-signed certificate. Open `https://localhost:5173`.

Vite is preconfigured to reverse proxy API requests to the Spring Boot core (`https://localhost:8443` or `https://localhost`), properly passing session cookies and CSRF protection headers.
